        <object label="&lt;b&gt;BUS = AUDIT LOG, NOT TRANSPORT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;5 publish sites, ALL in coordinator.js:&lt;br&gt; TASK_REQUEST TASK_RESULT&lt;br&gt; TASK_FAILED ESCALATION&lt;br&gt; TASK_RESULT (escalated)&lt;br&gt;1 subscribe site: coordinator.js&lt;br&gt; ESCALATION → console.log, nothing more&lt;br&gt;agents.js has 0 imports, 0 bus refs&lt;br&gt;handlers are called DIRECTLY&lt;br&gt;bus.js names HEARTBEAT + BROADCAST —&lt;br&gt;neither is ever published (README false)" class="card.invariant" id="card_bus">
