        </object>
        <object label="&lt;b&gt;ESCALATION: 4 NULL EXITS, 0 FIRINGS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;_tryEscalation, called at +&lt;br&gt;returns null on 4 guards, in code order:&lt;br&gt; a assigned card has no escalatesTo&lt;br&gt; b escalatesTo id not registered&lt;br&gt; c target lacks that skill/handler&lt;br&gt; d target handler throws&lt;br&gt;only 2 of 6 cards set escalatesTo&lt;br&gt;demo: maxRetries 1 + junior throws only&lt;br&gt;at attempt === 0 ⇒ unreachable&lt;br&gt;13 demo runs observed — Escalations: 0" class="card.failure" id="card_esc">
